   "hash": "f531daa86aa8a7a8",
   "does": "Static: classifies a recording's HRV: .insufficient (+useBaselineHRV) when RMSSD < baseline and the analysed span (window, or the session without one) is <5 min or a <3 h session lacks organized recovery (rule 1, isInsufficientData); .preSleep (+baseline) when sleep data exists and doesn't overlap the recording; .insufficient when RMSSD < baseline and session <3 h; else .good. Used by acceptance, ReanalysisService.reclassifyHRVQuality (reanalysis, manual window, sleep edits, retro-apply) and SampleDataLibrary.finalize.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Services/SessionAcceptanceService.swift::func SessionAcceptanceService.insufficientDataDecision(result:rmssd:baselineRmssd:sessionDuration:)",
